ready a gap of order 10^3 > 600, while 302->1635 does not occur before 40000 (step_18) nor in [40001,50000] (step_21), i.e. it happens only after t=50001 \u2014 more than 20000 time units after the 722->302 event. Alternative first hops cannot repair this: 767->988 has no event before 40000 (step_22) and 988 only reaches 1439/1894 (step_10), neither of which is an in-neighbour of 302 (step_12); 767->1719 occurs before 40000 (step_23) and 1719 only reaches 183/546 (step_11), requiring 3+ further hops to span >10000 time units with a 600-unit cap. No chain of interactions from 767 to 1635 satisfies the 600-unit inter-event delay, so the static connection is not a time-respecting cascade.", "evidence": [{"trace_id": "step_02", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_04", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_03", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_19", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_26", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_27", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_18", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_21", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_15", "role": "support"}, {"trace_id": "step_32", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_30", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_10", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_11", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_12", "role": "confounder_control"}, {"trace_id": "step_01", "role": "confounder_control"}]}, "raw_final_response": "Budget reached \u2014 concluding.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"t_049448d4\",\n  \"decision\": \"absent\",\n  \"mechanism\": \"cascade\",\n  \"entities\": [767, 1635, 722, 302, 106, 133],\n  \"window\": [20674, 59073],\n  \"confidence\": 0.75,\n  \"narrative\": \"767 and 1635 are both low-activity nodes (7 events each, step_02) and are connected only when time is ignored. 1635's only in-neighbours in the window are 106, 133 and 302 (step_04). The 106/133 route is in a component that does not contain 767 or its out-neighbours at all: the 2-hop neighbourhood of 133 up to t=35000 is {106,133,285,392,471,912,1707,1871} (step_32), and 106 has no in-edges in that period (step_30), so those deliveries to 1635 (steps_28,29) cannot have carried influence from 767. The only candidate route is 767 -> 722 -> 302 -> 1635. Timing localisation shows 767->722 fires in (22800, 25000] (steps_19,26) and 722->302 in (25001, 27500] (step_27), already a gap of order 10^3 > 600, while 302->1635 does not occur before 40000 (step_18) nor in [40001,50000] (step_21), i.e. it happens only after t=50001 \u2014 more than 20000 time units after the 722->302 event. Alternative first hops cannot repair this: 767->988 has no event before 40000 (step_22) and 988 only reaches 1439/1894 (step_10), neither of which is an in-neighbour of 302 (step_12); 767->1719 occurs before 40000 (step_23) and 1719 only reaches 183/546 (step_11), requiring 3+ further hops to span >10000 time units with a 600-unit cap. No chain of interactions from 767 to 1635 satisfies the 600-unit inter-event delay, so the static connection is not a time-respecting cascade.\"\n  ,\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_02\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_04\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_03\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_19\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_26\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_27\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_18\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_21\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_15\", \"role\": \"support\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_32\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_30\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_10\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_11\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n    {\"trace_id\": \"step_12\", \"role\": \"confounder_control\"},\n  